%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 75e7bea227aaf2b499307efe1ddc0480, type: 3}
  m_Name: MerchantDialog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialog
  NPCName: Merchant
  DialogLines:
  - text: "Careful\u2026 the containment lattice is barely holding!"
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: When the data storm struck, the Core fractured into three primary shards.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: Each shard now holds a different layer of your identity.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The reactor cannot repair itself until those fragments are recovered.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The shards are scattered across three sectors of the city.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The West Sector holds the Archives.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The East Sector contains the Systems District.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: And the South Sector... it leads into the Deep Network.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The Core still remembers the paths to those places.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: If you interact with the reactor, it will open a gateway to one of the
      sectors.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: Travel through it, recover the shard, and return it here.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: With each fragment restored, the Core may begin rebuilding what was lost.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: "But something about the fracture pattern is wrong\u2026 reactors do not
      fail like this."
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: It is almost as if the system rejected something.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: Go now. Use the Core to reach one of the sectors.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The Core will respond when you return.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
